Z||000000||sastian||03-31-2001||03:58 PM||||<BR>Looking for any help for setting the timing back on a Formula 88 after the distributor vibrated loose ( my guess is that the last mechanic that worked on it didnt have enough muscle to tighten it down right) one it came loos i figure it fouled my plugs. I get differing opinoins about whether or not to get new or brush them.  but i am without my hayes manual and need to know the steps to setting the timing again one the plugs arwe taken care of.||||reg||8
